OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FTurning cloudy with rain arriving from
OL,7,Fthe south on Tuesday, accompanied by a
OL,8,Fsoutheasterly breeze. Further rain on
OL,9,FWednesday, then brighter, but feeling
OL,10,Fcolder on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
